# character-view: load saved game A, make camp (E), View (V) a character and use the sheet's menus: items (ready, trade, drop, halve, join),
# money (trade, drop). Covers ovl19 (RunItemMenu, TradeItem, TradeMoney, ChooseAndDropMoney, ...), ovl21 money, ovl20. Found with the
# coverage-guided explorer (tools/c/explore_climb.py), pruned to the keys that matter. The camp screen is animated, so its keys are `press` with a wait of 30 ticks (a longer wait stalls the oracle at a blocking prompt).
clock 12:00:16.58
wheel
wait 20
key L
wait 20
key A
wait 300
press E
wait 30
press V
wait 30
press I
wait 30
press J
wait 30
press U
wait 30
press R
wait 30
press H
wait 30
press T
wait 30
press 1
wait 30
press ENTER
wait 30
press R
wait 30
press D
wait 30
press Y
wait 30
press D
wait 30
press HOME
wait 30
press SPACE
wait 30
press ESC
wait 30
press ESC
wait 30
press T
wait 30
press S
wait 30
press ESC
wait 30
press HOME
wait 30
press HOME
wait 30
shot view-end
wait 30
quit
